<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Linux Basics — Your First Commands</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;700;800&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --bg: #0e1116;
    --panel: #161b22;
    --panel-2: #1c222b;
    --border: #2a313c;
    --text: #d8dee9;
    --muted: #7d8798;
    --green: #4ec98b;
    --amber: #e8a94c;
    --blue: #6ea8fe;
    --red-dot: #ff5f56;
    --yellow-dot: #ffbd2e;
    --green-dot: #27c93f;
    --radius: 8px;
  }

  *{box-sizing:border-box;}

  html{scroll-behavior:smooth;}

  body{
    margin:0;
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 15% 0%, rgba(78,201,139,0.06), transparent 45%),
      radial-gradient(circle at 85% 20%, rgba(110,168,254,0.05), transparent 40%),
      var(--bg);
    color:var(--text);
    font-family:'Inter', sans-serif;
    line-height:1.65;
    -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
  }

  code, pre, .mono, .cmd, .prompt, nav .badge{
    font-family:'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
  }

  a{color:var(--blue); text-decoration:none;}
  a:hover{text-decoration:underline;}
  a:focus-visible, button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--green); outline-offset:2px;}

  /* ---------- Top bar ---------- */
  .topbar{
    position:sticky; top:0; z-index:50;
    background:rgba(14,17,22,0.85);
    backdrop-filter:blur(8px);
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);
    padding:14px 24px;
    display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px;
  }
  .dots{display:flex; gap:6px;}
  .dot{width:11px; height:11px; border-radius:50%;}
  .dot.red{background:var(--red-dot);}
  .dot.yellow{background:var(--yellow-dot);}
  .dot.green{background:var(--green-dot);}
  .topbar .path{color:var(--muted); font-size:13px;}
  .topbar .path .user{color:var(--green);}
  .topbar .path .at{color:var(--muted);}
  .topbar .path .host{color:var(--blue);}
  .topbar .path .sym{color:var(--amber);}

  /* ---------- Hero ---------- */
  .hero{
    max-width:920px; margin:0 auto; padding:64px 24px 32px;
  }
  .eyebrow{
    display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;
    font-family:'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size:12.5px; color:var(--green);
    border:1px solid rgba(78,201,139,0.35);
    background:rgba(78,201,139,0.08);
    padding:5px 12px; border-radius:999px;
    margin-bottom:22px;
  }
  .eyebrow::before{content:"●"; font-size:8px;}
  h1{
    font-family:'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-weight:800;
    font-size:clamp(28px, 5vw, 46px);
    line-height:1.15;
    margin:0 0 16px;
    letter-spacing:-0.01em;
  }
  h1 .caret{
    display:inline-block; width:0.55em; height:0.9em;
    background:var(--green); margin-left:6px;
    animation:blink 1.1s steps(1) infinite;
    vertical-align:-0.12em;
  }
  @keyframes blink{ 50%{opacity:0;} }
  .subtitle{color:var(--muted); font-size:17px; max-width:640px; margin-bottom:28px;}

  .hero-terminal{
    border:1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius:var(--radius);
    background:var(--panel);
    overflow:hidden;
    box-shadow:0 20px 60px -20px rgba(0,0,0,0.6);
  }
  .term-titlebar{
    display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;
    padding:10px 14px; background:var(--panel-2);
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .term-titlebar .name{margin-left:8px; font-size:12.5px; color:var(--muted); font-family:'JetBrains Mono', monospace;}
  .term-body{padding:18px 20px; font-size:14px;}
  .term-line{margin:0 0 6px; white-space:pre-wrap;}
  .term-line .prompt-user{color:var(--green);}
  .term-line .prompt-at{color:var(--muted);}
  .term-line .prompt-host{color:var(--blue);}
  .term-line .prompt-sym{color:var(--amber); margin-right:6px;}
  .term-line .out{color:var(--text); opacity:0.85;}
  .term-line .comment{color:var(--muted); font-style:italic;}

  /* ---------- Layout ---------- */
  .wrap{max-width:920px; margin:0 auto; padding:8px 24px 100px;}

  /* ---------- TOC ---------- */
  .toc{
    border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:var(--radius);
    background:var(--panel); margin:32px 0 56px; overflow:hidden;
  }
  .toc-head{
    padding:10px 16px; background:var(--panel-2); border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);
    font-family:'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size:12.5px; color:var(--muted);
  }
  .toc-body{padding:10px 8px;}
  .toc-body ol{list-style:none; margin:0; padding:0; counter-reset:chapter;}
  .toc-body li{counter-increment:chapter;}
  .toc-body a{
    display:flex; align-items:baseline; gap:10px;
    padding:9px 14px; border-radius:6px; color:var(--text);
    font-size:14.5px;
  }
  .toc-body a:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04); text-decoration:none;}
  .toc-body a::before{
    content: counter(chapter, decimal-leading-zero);
    color:var(--muted); font-family:'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size:12.5px;
  }

  /* ---------- Chapters ---------- */
  section.chapter{margin-bottom:56px; scroll-margin-top:90px;}
  .chapter-head{
    display:flex; align-items:baseline; gap:14px; margin-bottom:18px;
    padding-bottom:12px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .chapter-head .num{
    font-family:'JetBrains Mono', monospace; color:var(--green);
    font-size:14px; font-weight:700;
  }
  .chapter-head h2{
    margin:0; font-size:23px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:-0.01em;
  }

  p{margin:0 0 16px; color:var(--text);}
  .lede{color:var(--muted); margin-bottom:8px;}

  /* command card */
  .cmdcard{
    border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:var(--radius);
    background:var(--panel); margin:16px 0 20px; overflow:hidden;
  }
  .cmdcard .titlebar{
    display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; padding:9px 14px;
    background:var(--panel-2); border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .cmdcard .titlebar .label{font-size:12px; color:var(--muted); margin-left:6px;}
  .cmdcard .body{padding:14px 18px; font-size:14px;}
  .cmdcard .line{margin:0 0 4px; white-space:pre-wrap;}
  .cmdcard .in .prompt-user{color:var(--green);}
  .cmdcard .in .prompt-at{color:var(--muted);}
  .cmdcard .in .prompt-host{color:var(--blue);}
  .cmdcard .in .prompt-sym{color:var(--amber); margin-right:6px;}
  .cmdcard .out{color:var(--text); opacity:0.82;}

  /* scenario callout */
  .scenario{
    display:flex; gap:14px;
    border-left:3px solid var(--amber);
    background:rgba(232,169,76,0.06);
    border-radius:0 var(--radius) var(--radius) 0;
    padding:16px 18px; margin:18px 0;
  }
  .scenario .icon{font-size:18px; line-height:1.4;}
  .scenario .content .tag{
    font-family:'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size:11.5px; color:var(--amber);
    text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.06em; display:block; margin-bottom:6px;
  }
  .scenario .content p:last-child{margin-bottom:0;}

  /* small ref table */
  table.ref{
    width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; margin:14px 0 20px;
    border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:var(--radius); overflow:hidden;
  }
  table.ref th{
    text-align:left; background:var(--panel-2); color:var(--muted);
    font-family:'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size:12px; text-transform:uppercase;
    letter-spacing:0.04em; padding:10px 14px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);
  }
  table.ref td{
    padding:10px 14px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--border); font-size:14.5px;
  }
  table.ref tr:last-child td{border-bottom:none;}
  table.ref code{color:var(--green); font-size:13.5px;}

  /* ---------- Summary section ---------- */
  .summary-head{margin-bottom:18px;}
  .summary-head h2{font-size:24px; margin:0 0 6px;}
  .summary-head p{color:var(--muted); margin:0;}

  table.summary{width:100%; border-collapse:collapse;}
  table.summary th{
    text-align:left; padding:12px 14px; font-family:'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size:12px; color:var(--muted); text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.05em;
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);
  }
  table.summary td{padding:12px 14px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--border); font-size:14px; vertical-align:top;}
  table.summary td:first-child code{color:var(--green); font-weight:700;}
  table.summary tr:hover td{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);}

  /* ---------- Footer ---------- */
  footer{
    text-align:center; padding:40px 24px 60px; color:var(--muted);
    font-family:'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size:13px;
  }
  footer .star{color:var(--amber);}

  @media (max-width:640px){
    .topbar .path{font-size:11px;}
    h1{font-size:28px;}
    .chapter-head h2{font-size:19px;}
    table.ref, table.summary{font-size:13px;}
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){
    h1 .caret{animation:none;}
    html{scroll-behavior:auto;}
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="topbar">
  <div class="dots"><span class="dot red"></span><span class="dot yellow"></span><span class="dot green"></span></div>
  <div class="path"><span class="user">guide</span><span class="at">@</span><span class="host">github</span><span class="sym">:~$</span> cat linux-basics-first-commands.md</div>
</div>

<div class="hero">
  <span class="eyebrow">beginner-friendly · devops scenarios</span>
  <h1>Linux Basics: Your First Commands<span class="caret"></span></h1>
  <p class="subtitle">A hands-on guide to the Linux shell — every command explained with a real production scenario, so you understand not just <em>what</em> to type, but <em>why</em>.</p>

  <div class="hero-terminal">
    <div class="term-titlebar">
      <div class="dots"><span class="dot red"></span><span class="dot yellow"></span><span class="dot green"></span></div>
      <span class="name">azureadmin@prod-web01</span>
    </div>
    <div class="term-body">
      <p class="term-line"><span class="prompt-user">azureadmin</span><span class="prompt-at">@</span><span class="prompt-host">prod-web01</span><span class="prompt-sym">:~$</span> whoami</p>
      <p class="term-line out">azureadmin</p>
      <p class="term-line"><span class="prompt-user">azureadmin</span><span class="prompt-at">@</span><span class="prompt-host">prod-web01</span><span class="prompt-sym">:~$</span> hostname</p>
      <p class="term-line out">prod-web01</p>
      <p class="term-line comment"># two commands. zero guessing about where you are.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="wrap">

  <nav class="toc" aria-label="Table of contents">
    <div class="toc-head">ls -la ./chapters</div>
    <div class="toc-body">
      <ol>
        <li><a href="#ch1">Introduction to the Linux Shell</a></li>
